      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The thought that things would be easier without you is a very common, but very dangerous, thought when you're in this much pain. It's a sign of how deep the despair is, not a reflection of reality. Please know that the pain you feel is treatable, and there are people who genuinely want to help you find a way through this loop. If you are in crisis, please call or text 988 in the US and Canada, or contact your local emergency services.",
